  "bodyText": "Skip to main content\nSkip to footer content\nWe're now an in-store only retailer. Find everything you love in one of our 500 stores.\nSearch\nStores\nAccount\nGBP\nBOOKS \nART & CRAFT \nTOYS & GAMES \nSTATIONERY \nOFFERS \nINSPIRATION\nOver 500 Stores\nFind your local store\nThe Works Offers\nDiscover brilliant multi-buys\nOur Favourite Brands\nExplore brands you'll love\nHome\n /\nInspiration\n /\nScreen-Free Hobbies\nBack to All\nCategory\nActivity Sheets\nArt & Craft Ideas\nBook Inspiration\nBooks in Order\nChristmas Ideas\nCrochet Patterns\nEaster Ideas\nFamily Time Ideas\nHalloween Ideas\nIdeas For Kids\nInterviews\nParty Ideas\nRecipes\nScreen-Free Hobbies\nStudent Tips\nSocial\nFacebook\nInstagram\nTikTok\nPinterest\nYouTube\nScreen-Free Hobbies\n\nRediscover the joy of unplugging with our inspiring screen‑free hobbies. Creative pastimes, mindful activities and hands‑on fun to help you unwind and reconnect.\n\nThe Joy of Jigsaws: Why Puzzles Are the Perfect Winter Hobby\n25 Screen-Free Bedtime Short Stories for Children\n\nDiscover 25 screen-free bedtime short stories perfect for kids, toddlers and pre-schoolers. Make bedtime routines easy and weeknights magical.\n\nHow to Find Hobbies as an Adult\n\nIf you’re ready to reclaim your free time and enjoy time well spent, read our top tips on finding a new hobby as an adult.\n\nFree Simple Crochet Patterns\n\nDiscover free, easy crochet patterns perfect for beginners.\n\nSign up for our latest news and offers:\nSIGN ME UP\nLike. Follow. Share.\n \n \n \n \nNeed Help?\nSupport Centre\nTerms & Conditions\nFAQ\nAbout The Works\nAbout Us\nCorporation Information\nCareers\nPrivacy Policy\nUseful Links\nStores\nInspiration\nNational Literacy Trust\nBarnardo's - Play it Forward!\nMore Useful Links\nStore Events\nProduct Recalls\nDeclaration of Conformity\nWEEE and Battery Information\n\n© 2026 - The Works Stores Ltd.",
